From a0dfd06b1ec548135b8ed4d25e857778ec6f4810 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 19:25:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sync vendored AlmaGag engine with latest upstream

Replace the embedded AlmaGag package with the current version from
Josexato/AlmaGag (post-PR #31): new auto layout engine (layout/engine.py,
strategies/), theme tokens, phase areas, decision/diamond icons, viewbox
cropping, and removal of the old layout/auto and layout/laf modules.

The gagrender.py bridge and MainActivity need no changes: the
generate_diagram(json_file, output_file=...) entry point is unchanged,
dependencies remain svgwrite-only, and the engine was verified to render
all upstream example/fixture .sdjf files through the bridge, including
with a read-only working directory as on Android.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q2hcn6pJXmJi1Hj2kjxV8Z
